    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NatLee/blur-generator/main/docs/images/depth-map-test.png",
    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NatLee/blur-generator/main/docs/images/readme/focus-rocks.jpg"
  ],
  "imageCaptions": [
    "",
    "Motion blur on a logo: the same colours, smeared along one direction",
    "Lens blur by depth: the rocks up front melt into bokeh, the far temple stays sharp",
    "The depth map it used: brighter means nearer, so the front gets the most blur",
    "Focused on the rock pile instead, a homemade portrait mode"
  ],
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/NatLee/blur-generator",
  "category": "Computer Vision",
